    {
      "name": "Connected PR disclosures",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "layer",
      "description": "Native expandable layers retain neighboring contributions and their dependency connector.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-stack\"><details class=\"ds-layer\"><summary><span class=\"ds-number\">#120</span><span class=\"ds-title\">Introduce a bounded queue</span><span class=\"ds-role\">Foundation</span><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></summary><p class=\"ds-explanation\">Hold up to three commands. New arrivals wait when the queue is full.</p></details><details class=\"ds-layer\" open><summary><span class=\"ds-number\">#121</span><span class=\"ds-title\">Route worker commands</span><span class=\"ds-role\">Behavior</span><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></summary><p class=\"ds-explanation\">Follow each command from the queue to the worker.</p></details></div>",
      "css": ".ds-stack{color:var(--ink,#1e2537);font:400 16px/1.55 Onest,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-layer{position:relative;}.ds-layer+.ds-layer{margin-top:15px;}.ds-layer+.ds-layer:before{content:\"\";position:absolute;width:1px;height:15px;background:var(--blue,#213b8e);left:34px;top:-15px;}.ds-layer summary{list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;min-height:52px;padding:10px 22px;border:1px solid #a9b7d8;border-radius:7px;background:var(--paper,#fff);cursor:pointer;transition:background .16s,color .16s;}.ds-layer summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}.ds-layer summary:hover{background:#edf2ff;}.ds-layer[open] summary{background:var(--blue,#213b8e);color:var(--paper,#fff);border-color:var(--blue,#213b8e);}.ds-layer[open] summary>svg{transform:rotate(90deg);}.ds-layer summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #3865df;outline-offset:5px;}.ds-number{font-size:16px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}.ds-title{font-size:18px;font-weight:550;}.ds-role{margin-left:auto;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;}.ds-explanation{margin:0;padding:18px 0 4px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted,#52617e);max-width:54ch;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-layer summary{gap:10px;padding:13px 12px;min-height:58px;}.ds-title{font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;}.ds-number{font-size:13px;}.ds-role{display:none;}.ds-layer summary>svg{margin-left:auto;flex-shrink:0;}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-layer summary{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Source evidence pane",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "source-pane",
      "description": "A code surface pairs the highlighted source line with a link to the real workspace.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-source\" aria-label=\"Example source\"><div class=\"ds-source-heading\"><span>queue.ts</span><span>Example source</span></div><pre><code><span class=\"ds-line ds-current\"><span class=\"ds-line-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span>const queue = new Queue({ capacity: 3 });</span><span class=\"ds-line\"><span class=\"ds-line-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span>queue.tryPush(commandA);</span></code></pre><a class=\"ds-source-link\" href=\"#inside\">See the real review workspace <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h16\"/><path d=\"m13 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a></section>",
      "css": ".ds-source{min-width:0;background:var(--canvas,#e8edf9);color:var(--ink,#1e2537);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;font:400 16px/1.55 Onest,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-source-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #d3dced;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#52617e);}.ds-source-heading span:first-child{color:var(--ink,#1e2537);font-family:monospace;}.ds-source pre{margin:0;padding:13px 0;overflow-x:auto;font:400 12px/2 'SFMono-Regular',Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:#9caed1 #e8edf9;}.ds-source code{font-family:'SFMono-Regular',Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-variant-ligatures:none;}.ds-line{display:block;min-width:max-content;padding:0 15px 0 0;border-left:2px solid transparent;}.ds-current{background:#d6e1f8;border-left-color:var(--blue,#213b8e);}.ds-line-number{display:inline-block;user-select:none;width:30px;text-align:center;color:#5c6c8c;}.ds-source-link{padding:10px 16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;font-size:12px;border-top:1px solid #d3dced;color:var(--blue,#213b8e);text-decoration:none;text-underline-offset:.22em;}.ds-source-link:hover{text-decoration:underline;}.ds-source-link:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #3865df;outline-offset:5px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Install command",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "command-copy",
      "description": "Selectable monospace text and a copy control share one bordered container.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-command\"><code>brew tap oddur/gnosis &amp;&amp; brew install --cask gnosis</code><button class=\"ds-icon\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy Homebrew install command\"><svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 9h12v12H9z\"/><path d=\"M15 9V3H3v12h6\"/></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-icon{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;min-width:36px;min-height:36px;border:0;background:transparent;border-radius:6px;color:var(--blue,#213b8e);font:400 13px/1.55 Onest,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;}.ds-icon:hover:not(:disabled){background:#dce7ff;}.ds-icon:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #3865df;outline-offset:5px;}.ds-icon:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default;}.ds-command{background:var(--paper,#fff);color:var(--ink,#1e2537);border:1px solid #b7c5df;border-radius:8px;padding:14px 14px 14px 18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;}.ds-command code{font:400 12px/1.55 'SFMono-Regular',Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-variant-ligatures:none;overflow-wrap:anywhere;user-select:all;flex:1;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-command{padding:12px;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Feature navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "feature-tab",
      "description": "Six feature links with selected underline and weight. This snippet shows the enhanced visual state; the source script supplies keyboard selection and panel switching.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-feature-tabs\" aria-label=\"Explore features\" role=\"tablist\"><a href=\"#feature-stacks\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">Stacks</a><a href=\"#feature-changes\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Diffs &amp; commits</a><a href=\"#feature-markdown\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Markdown</a><a href=\"#feature-chat\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Ask questions</a><a href=\"#feature-checks\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Checks</a><a href=\"#feature-conflicts\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Resolve conflicts</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-feature-tabs{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#bdc9e1);font:400 16px/1.55 Onest,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-feature-tabs a{padding:14px 6px;font-size:15px;color:var(--muted,#52617e);border-bottom:2px solid transparent;text-decoration:none;}.ds-feature-tabs a:hover{color:var(--blue,#213b8e);background:var(--canvas,#e8edf9);}.ds-feature-tabs a[aria-selected=\"true\"]{color:var(--blue,#213b8e);border-bottom-color:var(--blue,#213b8e);font-weight:600;}.ds-feature-tabs a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #3865df;outline-offset:5px;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-feature-tabs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:4px;}.ds-feature-tabs a{font-size:12px;text-align:center;padding:12px 2px;min-height:44px;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Change, unpacked",
    "overview": "The website presents Gnosis as an open-source tool, with a developer explaining its behavior to another developer. Feature names, factual captions, and plain installation instructions carry the content. Cool lavender surfaces, cobalt actions, and Onest type keep the presentation calm and technical.\n\nCompact sections give real screenshots and an interactive code example most of the space. Fine lines explain relationships. Motion shows a mechanism, while text and manual controls preserve its meaning without movement. Source, setup, and issue links make the project directly accessible.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Cool lavender canvas, cobalt emphasis, and graphite text.",
      "Moderate, close-set headings that name features and actions.",
      "Connected layers that preserve context around the selected contribution.",
      "Real screenshots with captions and explicit sample context.",
      "Flat surfaces, fine borders, and purposeful motion.",
      "Factual descriptions, visible project links, and plain installation instructions."
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** use the website tokens for new website surfaces.",
      "**Do** connect explanations to visible source evidence.",
      "**Do** keep screenshot captions and sample context explicit.",
      "**Do** preserve keyboard focus, meaningful text labels, and manual playback controls.",
      "**Do** keep installation and release fallbacks actionable.",
      "**Do** keep feature content accessible without JavaScript.",
      "**Do** preserve full screenshots inside the stable feature frame.",
      "**Do** use factual feature names, screenshot captions, and setup instructions.",
      "**Do** keep source, setup, and issue links easy to find."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** import desktop application styling into website controls.",
      "**Don't** replace real product evidence with fabricated application screenshots.",
      "**Don't** start explanatory animation automatically.",
      "**Don't** communicate state through color alone.",
      "**Don't** add shadows to the flat surface hierarchy.",
      "**Don't** use paired slogans, generic benefit claims, or corporate sales language.",
      "**Don't** turn setup instructions into a large promotional color band."
    ]
  }
}
